sqlgen: error: unknown command: frobnicate
usage: sqlgen <command> [options]

commands:
  init      write a configuration with every default (sqlgen.json, or -c)
  model     load the schema and print its model as JSON
  check     load the schema and check it against the rules; writes nothing
  report    print the model of an existing database as JSON, and check it
            (rule levels from -c when given, else the defaults)
  generate  write the generated sources (not implemented)

options:
  -c, --config <file>  configuration (default: sqlgen.json, written with every
                       default when it does not exist)
  -o, --output <file>  write to a file instead of standard output
      --db <file>      the database to report on
      --key <key>      its encryption key (needs a build with CIPHER=1)
      --strict         treat rule warnings as errors
  -h, --help           this text
      --version        sqlgen and SQLite versions
